00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:02.568
-♪ Face it ♪
-♪ Face it ♪

00:00:02.568 --> 00:00:05.070
-♪ Face it ♪
-♪ Face it challenge ♪

00:00:05.070 --> 00:00:07.506
-Here's how it works.
Each round we'll draw a card,

00:00:07.506 --> 00:00:10.176
and it will tell us what face
that we both have to make.

00:00:10.176 --> 00:00:12.245
Okay? And then we're going
to look in our mirrors,

00:00:12.245 --> 00:00:15.448
make our faces, and then reveal
them on the count of three.

00:00:15.448 --> 00:00:17.349
We'll stare at each other
for 10 seconds

00:00:17.349 --> 00:00:18.985
while trying to hold our faces.

00:00:18.985 --> 00:00:20.620
The first person to crack
a smile --

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:22.955
[ Laughter ]
-Pfft. Dude...

00:00:22.955 --> 00:00:25.892
-This is gonna --
-This is gonna last 5 seconds.

00:00:25.892 --> 00:00:29.529
-Crack a smile, laugh,
or break the face loses.

00:00:29.529 --> 00:00:32.899
-Do they not know who we are?
-Let's see -- Let's see what

00:00:32.899 --> 00:00:35.234
our first face is.
-Uh-huh.

00:00:35.234 --> 00:00:41.007 line:0%
-Screaming on a roller coaster.
-Okay.

00:00:41.007 --> 00:00:46.078 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:46.078 --> 00:00:47.613 line:0%
